# Backend-only configuration example.
# In the deployed AWS Lambda environment, prefer the Lambda execution role (IAM).
# Optional: Amazon Bedrock API key for SDKs/environments that support Bedrock API-key auth.
# Never prefix secrets with VITE_ or commit real secrets to source control.
AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK=
MODEL_ID=amazon.nova-lite-v1:0
TABLE_NAME=
ALLOWED_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
